    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72620.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "That would depend basically on the feeling of the people that are in the district. I can't begin to tell you the number of congressional districts that are represented by people other than majority in that district, while I certainly do appreciate the fact that every group of people should want to see someone that's closer to their color, their complexion, their culture in that seat. I really truly believe that the major qualification is who would be the best representative of the people in the entire district.",
