    "turn_text": "And a couple of my opponents have taken advantage of this. two years ago, some maybe four years ago. And as Biana decided two months ago that he too was going to participate in this election. And so all I can say is that if we take advantage of the, I call it a resume of my record of having served with the almost total support of my effectiveness from almost every public official and the unions, I really think that I deserve an opportunity to serve two years again for my country and certainly the Congress agrees and I hope to persuade my new as well as the old looking constituencies that I've done a pretty darn good job and that goes unchallenged.",
