  {
    "episode_id": 72620,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72620.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 13,
    "turn_text": "So speaking of your newer constituencies with a majority Latino population in your district, I'm sure your focus must be increasingly shifting to the issue of immigration. And I wonder what your position is on President Obama's recent executive order, suspending deportations for undocumented young people who were brought to the U.S. at a young age by their parents.",
