        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Newcomers in the district were ethnically distinct from earlier immigrant groups like Italians, Irish, and Jews.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Lenaris became the first Dominican elected to public office in the district.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The current immigration system is hypocritical because it depends on undocumented workers while opposing their legalization.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Many sectors of the U.S. economy—including hotels, hospitality, industry, and agriculture—are economically dependent on undocumented immigrants.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "It would be impractical and unjust to deport approximately 11 million undocumented individuals.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "The Dream Act represents a case of hypocrisy in immigration policy.",
        "confidence": 0.84
      },
      {
