        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Hypocrisy in policy becomes evident when systems depend on labor they simultaneously criminalize.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Progressive political coalitions are effective vehicles for advancing inclusive policies.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Deporting millions would cause disproportionate harm to communities and national economic stability.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
